    routePath: 'chemin-de-fer',
    LLM: 'Game: Chemin de Fer. Type: Rotating-Banker Baccarat. Rules: 6 decks. Player chooses to draw or stand on 5 points. Banker has similar agency. Closest to 9 wins. House edge is lower for Banker.',
    Player: "The shoe has reached you! Will you accept the Bank? Name your stake. Punters, place your bets. Will someone cry 'Banco' and challenge the table?",
